    "title": "Gary Woodland opens up on PTSD after 2023 brain surgery",
    "text": "PGAGary Woodland reveals PTSD battle after brain surgery to remove tumor Tom D'AngeloPalm Beach PostMarch 10, 2026, 8:16 a.m. ETPONTE VEDRA BEACH — Gary Woodland revealed he has been battling post-traumatic stress disorder since undergoing brain surgery in 2023 and said he \"can't waste energy\" any longer attempting to hide his condition.\"Every week, I come out and everyone is so excited and happy that I'm back,\" Woodland, the Delray Beach resident, said in an interview with Golf Channel. \"I hear that every week, 'It's so nice to see you passed this. It's so nice to see you 100%.'",
